%% SQLAlchemy ORM Session Lifecycle
%% Shows how database sessions are managed in the FastAPI application

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as FastAPI Application
    participant Container as DI Container
    participant DBSession as DatabaseSession
    participant Engine as AsyncEngine
    participant Pool as Connection Pool
    participant MySQL as MySQL Database

    Note over App,MySQL: Application Startup (Lifespan)
    App->>+Container: startup()
    Container->>+DBSession: connect()
    DBSession->>+Engine: create_async_engine()<br/>pool_size=5, max_overflow=10
    Engine->>+Pool: Initialize connection pool
    Pool->>+MySQL: Establish initial connections
    MySQL-->>-Pool: Connections ready
    Pool-->>-Engine: Pool initialized
    Engine-->>-DBSession: Engine ready
    DBSession-->>-Container: Connected
    Container-->>-App: Ready to serve requests

    Note over App,MySQL: Request Handling (Per Request)
    App->>+Container: get_container()
    Container->>Container: item_service property
    Container->>+DBSession: session_factory
    DBSession-->>-Container: async_sessionmaker

    Note over App,MySQL: Repository Operation (e.g., create)
    Container->>+ItemRepo: ItemRepository(session_factory)
    ItemRepo->>+DBSession: async with session_factory() as session
    DBSession->>+Pool: Acquire connection from pool
    Pool-->>-DBSession: AsyncSession
    DBSession-->>-ItemRepo: session context
    ItemRepo->>ItemRepo: item = ItemModel(...)
    ItemRepo->>+MySQL: session.add(item)
    ItemRepo->>MySQL: session.commit()
    MySQL-->>-ItemRepo: Committed
    ItemRepo->>+MySQL: session.refresh(item)
    MySQL-->>-ItemRepo: Item with ID
    ItemRepo->>Pool: Release connection (context exit)
    ItemRepo-->>-Container: Return ItemModel

    Note over App,MySQL: Application Shutdown (Lifespan)
    App->>+Container: shutdown()
    Container->>+DBSession: disconnect()
    DBSession->>+Engine: dispose()
    Engine->>+Pool: Close all connections
    Pool->>MySQL: Close connections
    Pool-->>-Engine: Disposed
    Engine-->>-DBSession: Disconnected
    DBSession-->>-Container: Disconnected
    Container-->>-App: Shutdown complete
